Now we thought multithreading as multiple threads executing parallely
But it is not 
CPU rapidly switches between threads (context switching), 
giving the illusion of parallelism due to the high speed of switching

Due to its speed and efficient execution we feel that way.

If we have multiple CPU then multiple CPU will be executed 
parallely

Benefits:
-->High Performace by 
parallelism
-->Resource sharing

Challenges of MultiThreading:

--->Concurrency Issue(deadlock, data inconsistency etc)
--->Synchonized Overhead



